                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>On March 6 the Allied High Commissioners delivered to the Federal Chancellor, as
                    a reply to his assurance on debts, the text of the letter transmitted in Sigto
                    464, February 22, page 1427, with the following changes: (1) inclusion of the
                    date “6 March, 1951” for the blank in the first paragraph, (2) listing of the
                    three governments in alphabetical order in the first and last paragraphs, and
                    (3) changing the last phrase of the second sentence of the fourth paragraph to
                    read “and interested Governments including the Federal Government.”
                    (762A.00/3–150)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
